msgstr "Titlu"

#: widget.php:134
msgid "Hide Link?"
msgstr "Aħbi l-link?"

msgid "Windspeed Converter – How to use"
msgstr "Windspeed Converter – Kif tużah"

msgid "How to use"
msgstr "Kif tużah"

msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Dokumentazzjoni"

msgid "Support"
msgstr "Appoġġ"

msgid "Windspeed Converter is ready."
msgstr "Windspeed Converter huwa lest."

#. translators: %s: the [windspeed_converter] shortcode.
msgid "Add the converter to any page with the “Windspeed Converter” block, the shortcode %s or the widget."
msgstr "Żid il-konvertitur ma' kwalunkwe paġna bil-blokk “Windspeed Converter”, bix-shortcode %s jew bil-widget."

msgid "Open the guide"
msgstr "Iftaħ il-gwida"

msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "Aħbi"

msgid "The converter lets visitors enter one wind speed value and instantly calculates the others."
msgstr "Il-viżitaturi jdaħħlu valur wieħed tal-veloċità tar-riħ u l-konvertitur jikkalkula immedjatament l-oħrajn."

msgid "Block editor"
msgstr "Editur tal-blokki"

msgid "Search for “Windspeed Converter” in the block inserter and add the block. Use the block settings in the sidebar to show or hide individual fields."
msgstr "Fittex “Windspeed Converter” fl-inseritur tal-blokki u żid il-blokk. Uża s-settings tal-blokk fil-bar tal-ġenb biex turi jew taħbi oqsma individwali."

msgid "Shortcode"
msgstr "Shortcode"

msgid "Insert the converter into any post or page with this shortcode:"
msgstr "Daħħal il-konvertitur f'artiklu jew paġna b'dan ix-shortcode:"

msgid "All fields are shown by default. Hide individual fields with attributes:"
msgstr "B'mod awtomatiku jintwerew l-oqsma kollha. Aħbi oqsma individwali bl-attributi:"

#. translators: %s: name of the converter field, e.g. "Km/h".
msgid "Hides the “%s” field"
msgstr "Jaħbi l-qasam “%s”"

msgid "Hides the backlink"
msgstr "Jaħbi l-link tar-ritorn"

msgid "Attributes can be combined:"
msgstr "L-attributi jistgħu jiġu kkombinati:"

msgid "Widget"
msgstr "Widget"

#. translators: %s: translated name of the widget.
msgid "Add the “%s” widget under Appearance → Widgets, set a title and tick the fields you want to show."
msgstr "Żid il-widget “%s” taħt Dehra → Widgets, agħti titlu u mmarka l-oqsma li trid."

msgid "Languages"
msgstr "Lingwi"

msgid "Translations for all 24 official EU languages are bundled. The converter follows the site language set under Settings → General."
msgstr "Inklużi traduzzjonijiet fl-24 lingwa uffiċjali kollha tal-UE. Il-konvertitur isegwi l-lingwa tas-sit issettjata taħt Settings → Ġenerali."

msgid "Need help?"
msgstr "Teħtieġ għajnuna?"

msgid "Support forum"
msgstr "Forum tal-appoġġ"

msgid "Plugin page on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Paġna tal-plugin fuq WordPress.org"

msgid "Wind speed converter: visitors enter one value (km/h, mph, Beaufort, m/s or knots) and instantly get the others."
msgstr "Konvertitur tal-veloċità tar-riħ: il-viżitaturi jdaħħlu valur wieħed (km/h, mph, Beaufort, m/s jew għoqiedi) u jiksbu immedjatament l-oħrajn."

msgid "Fields"
msgstr "Oqsma"

msgid "Show backlink"
msgstr "Uri l-link tar-ritorn"

msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Windspeed Converter"
msgstr "Windspeed Converter"

msgctxt "block description"
msgid "Let visitors convert wind speeds between km/h, mph, Beaufort, m/s and knots."
msgstr "Ħalli l-viżitaturi jikkonvertu l-veloċità tar-riħ bejn km/h, mph, Beaufort, m/s u għoqiedi."
